# OFF by default (else-after-exit.config.json enables it). Hits: the else keyword of an
# if whose then-branch ends in Exit / Break / Continue / raise.
# FP shapes (non-hits): then-branch without an unconditional exit, exit only inside a
# nested conditional of the then-branch, an if with no else.
else-after-exit 11
else-after-exit 26
else-after-exit 35
!else-after-exit 44
!else-after-exit 55
!else-after-exit 61
